  "data": {
    "pack": "Combat Patrol",
    "summary": "As your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins, one of your **CROWE'S SANCTIFIERS** units may start this [action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions) at an unsanctified **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** in range. It can be started once per turn. It finishes when your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) ends, or when the battle ends if sooner. Unless the unit is **battle-shocked** then, your army marks that **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** as **sanctified**.",
